There are close to 20 plus miles of trails, old jammer (logging) roads, fire roads and xc[ ski] trails open to[ Mountain] Bikers. Pick up a[ map] at the Chelan[ Ranger] District located next to the Caravel Resort.
The Gulch rocks, if you have a shuttle to the top. Echo[ Ridge] XC trails are good, plenty of different trails to ride. Plenty of[ jumps] on the[ gul]ch and lots of different spurs off the main trail, look for them.

